mainmenu "DRG27 Fortissax AMS"

source "Kconfig.zephyr"

menu "DRG27 AMS migration safety policy"

config AMS_BMS_AUTHORITY
    bool "Permit BMS_OK assertion authority"
    default n
    help
      Controls whether the application is allowed to contain BMS_OK
      assertion authority.

      This MUST remain disabled during the early Zephyr migration.
      Z-003 also enforces this with a C BUILD_ASSERT.

config AMS_BALANCE_AUTHORITY
    bool "Permit balancing authority"
    default n
    help
      Controls whether the application is allowed to command cell
      balancing.

      This MUST remain disabled during the early Zephyr migration.
      Z-003 also enforces this with a C BUILD_ASSERT.

config AMS_IMD_TARGET_VALIDATED
    bool "Claim physical IMD target validation"
    default n
    help
      Release-evidence gate corresponding to the v2.6.27
      AMS_IMD_TARGET_VALIDATED build gate. Z-013 must remain disabled:
      this stage proves source/SIL/target-build behavior only and does not
      claim physical PWM/status validation of the installed IMD.

endmenu